OL,3,AHuge crowds turn out in support of
OL,4,Aresidents over Drumcree parade dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FRallies were held on both sides of the
OL,7,FDrumcree parade dispute on Saturday as
OL,8,Fthe stand-off between Garvaghy Road
OL,9,Fresidents and the Portadown District
OL,10,FOrange Lodge continues.
OL,12,FAddressing thousands of people at an
OL,13,Fevent on the Garvaghy Road, First
OL,14,FMinister and Sinn Fein vice president
OL,15,FMichelle O'Neill said she heard the
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,17,FBryant "talk about being between a rock
OL,18,Fand a hard place", adding she has
OL,19,F"never heard such nonsense, this is
OL,20,Fbetween right and wrong".
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
