OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHuge crowds turn out in support of
OL,4,Aresidents over Drumcree parade dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,7,F(PSNI) said anyone blocking the
OL,8,FGarvaghy Road will be "treated as
OL,9,Fparticipating in an unnotified and
OL,10,Ftherefore illegal protest and that
OL,11,Fanyone "found to have broken the law
OL,12,Fwill face criminal justice
OL,13,Fconsequences".
OL,15,FSpeaking at Drumcree church, Democratic
OL,16,FUnionist Party (DUP) MP Carla Lockhart
OL,17,Frepeated calls for PSNI Chief Constable
OL,18,FJon Boutcher and his officers to "do
OL,19,Ftheir job" and facilitate the parade,
OL,20,Fdescribing the current impasse as "mob
OL,21,Frule".
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
